# The emulator-test image (scripts/Dockerfile.emulator-test) rebuilds
# every firmware .dict/.elf and the simavr bridge from source, so none
# of these need to enter the build context. Keeping them out makes the
# `docker build` context transfer fast and stops stale host artifacts
# from being COPYed into /klipper.
.git
out
ci_build
.claude
.run_logs
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
# Built C-helper library: chelper.get_ffi() compiles it in-container. A
# host-built copy (e.g. an arm64 .so rsynced onto an x86_64 build host)
# would be COPYed in, look "up to date" by mtime, and make get_ffi() skip
# the rebuild then fail to dlopen the wrong-arch binary.
*.so
_test_*
